archable collection of everything that matters to you.\n\n### Features\n\n• Save links from your favorite apps and browsers using the Share Sheet\n• Organize content into collections that match your workflow\n• Add tags and personal notes to make everything easier to find\n• Search across your saved content in seconds\n• View rich previews with titles, descriptions, and images\n• Revisit saved content anytime without digging through messages or bookmarks\n• Clean, fast, and distraction-free interface designed for everyday use\n\n### Perfect for\n\n• Articles you want to read later\n• YouTube videos and tutorials\n• Reddit discussions worth revisiting\n• X (Twitter) threads and posts\n• Shopping finds and products\n• Recipes and travel ideas\n• Learning resources and documentation\n• Anything else you don't want to forget\n\nWhether you're researching, learning, planning a trip, collecting inspiration, or simply trying to keep your digital life organized, Don'tForgetMe helps ensure nothing important slips away.\n\nSave it once. Find it anytime.", "trackCensoredName": "DFM : Don't Forget Me", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/dfm-dont-forget-me/id6786020940?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "bundleId": "com.dfm.navneet", "userRatingCount": 0}]}